<h1>Project Proposal</h1>

<h2>Project Title:</h2>
<p>
Informational Website for the Faculty of Information Technology - Omar Al-Mukhtar University
</p>


<h2>Team Members:</h2>
<ul>
<li>Mohammed Hassan Mohammed - University ID: 1724453</li>
